cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this archive, please cite it as below."
title: "Lunar Gravity Force-Trajectory Gap Reproducibility Archive"
abstract: >-
  Source, experiment configurations, campaign manifests, analysis scripts and
  reproducibility records for a study of fixed-budget spherical-harmonic degree
  allocation on the degree-1800 GRAIL JGGRX_1800F lunar gravity field, and of
  the gap between trajectory-averaged truncation-force error and trajectory
  error.
type: software
